/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 40 0 R
/E (To support revenue expansion by enhancing user interaction, maximizing time spent, and increasing listener engagement on Spotify. This will be achieved by introducing Reward-Based Ad Skipping and Enhanced Regional Content for freemium users, allowing limited playback controls based on listening behaviour. This initiative aims to boost Time Spent Listening \(TSL\), improve ad-supported revenue, and drive user satisfaction. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
